{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@3416","endTime":343955.462,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 19\nLead Management.\n\nA form-led web experience presenting lead information fields and a compact set of service choices.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nLead capture & forms\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nA focused space for the first enquiry.\n\nThe Lead Management artwork centers on a single information-entry form. A short introduction, grouped fields, and a service-choice area create a clear path through the page. The portfolio includes desktop views of this focused form experience rather than evidence of a broader CRM implementation.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Lead Management's original project material.\n\n01\nEnquiry form\n\nThe central page gathers information through labeled input fields.\n\n02\nGrouped information\n\nField groups separate the different parts of the enquiry.\n\n03\nService choices\n\nIcon-led choices appear below the main form content.\n\n04\nSubmission action\n\nA contrasting orange button marks the end of the visible flow.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nLead capture & forms\n\nOrange accents identify the primary action and selected details within a predominantly white layout. A narrow central form keeps the input area contained, with ample surrounding space preventing the interface from competing with its main task.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Lead Management.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nLead Management's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nLead Management / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nLivSocial\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nSOCIAL & COMMUNITY\nLivSocial\nDIGITAL ASSETS & DISCOVERY\nStreamDataX\nCHILDCARE & FAMILY\nLittle Butterflies\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
